    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9Q8fkDtaS4Rd0jejuahz3w/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbWFFVkpVa05EVVdSZlZXOVVTRWt6UjNod1kzYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "No music, a quite place to enjoy your moment, food and work. A good place for grouping, family or even your kids. I brought my kids while here a several weeks ago and spent a lot of time in their playground. The parking lot is spacious, they have mosque and upstair floor for some event",
