    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9Q8fkDtaS4Rd0jejuahz3w/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREdmF2TGtBRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Nestled on a quaint street corner, this charming coffee shop immediately catches the eye with its warm and inviting atmosphere. Upon entering, the smell of freshly brewed coffee greets you, setting the mood for a delightful experience ahead.\n\nThe cozy seating area is adorned with plush chairs and wooden tables, creating a welcoming ambiance perfect for both solo visits or catching up with friends. The walls are adorned with artwork, adding to the unique and artistic vibe of the place.\n\nThe highlight of this coffee shop is undeniably the coffee. From rich espressos to creamy lattes, every cup is crafted with precision and care, resulting in a perfect balance of flavor and aroma. The baristas are knowledgeable and passionate about their craft, ensuring that every sip is a delight for the senses.\n\nIn addition to their exceptional coffee, the menu boasts an array of delicious treats and bites. Freshly croissant and yummy samosa, every item is made with high-quality ingredients and packed with flavor. The pisang goreng with brown sugar is a must-try for breakfast or brunch.\n\nOverall, this coffee shop is a hidden gem that offers a delightful escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. Whether you're looking for a quick pick-me-up or a cozy spot to relax, this coffee shop is sure to exceed your expectations with its great coffee, yummy food, and charming ambiance.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Nestled on a quaint street corner, this charming coffee shop immediately catches the eye with its warm and inviting atmosphere. Upon entering, the smell of freshly brewed coffee greets you, setting the mood for a delightful experience ahead.\n\nThe cozy seating area is adorned with plush chairs and wooden tables, creating a welcoming ambiance perfect for both solo visits or catching up with friends. The walls are adorned with artwork, adding to the unique and artistic vibe of the place.\n\nThe highlight of this coffee shop is undeniably the coffee. From rich espressos to creamy lattes, every cup is crafted with precision and care, resulting in a perfect balance of flavor and aroma. The baristas are knowledgeable and passionate about their craft, ensuring that every sip is a delight for the senses.\n\nIn addition to their exceptional coffee, the menu boasts an array of delicious treats and bites. Freshly croissant and yummy samosa, every item is made with high-quality ingredients and packed with flavor. The pisang goreng with brown sugar is a must-try for breakfast or brunch.\n\nOverall, this coffee shop is a hidden gem that offers a delightful escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. Whether you're looking for a quick pick-me-up or a cozy spot to relax, this coffee shop is sure to exceed your expectations with its great coffee, yummy food, and charming ambiance.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
