    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9Q8fkDtaS4Rd0jejuahz3w/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5dC1MYV9RRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Recommendation for eating with family, here the place is comfortable and quiet because there is no music here, there is a playground area for children, and a prayer room.\nfor the food, I ordered mie aceh beef wagyu and mie goreng oriental, the Mie Aceh beef wagyu were delicious and tasted of broth, the meat was tender and the pieces were quite large,\nI tried the hot cappuccino and hot coffee latte, the coffee was served with peanut cake and given 2 kinds of sugar sachets so that we could determine the level of sweetness",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
